    "Automatic handling of node failures"
  ],
  "problemStatement": "Design a distributed **key-value store** like Amazon Dynamo or Cassandra with `put(key, value)` and `get(key)`.\n\nThe store must spread data over many nodes, survive node failures, and let the operator tune consistency against availability.",
